id: llm-summary
name: LLM summary
description: A markdown summary an agent writes on request so a later session can pick up the work.
types:
- ext: .llm_summary
  render_as: .md
guidance: Markdown. An agent writes <name>.llm_summary at the cell root when asked for a summary or a handoff, and a
  later run reads it in full when asked to continue from it.
examples: []
